-- throw: out-of-range numeric VALUES expression must raise
-3599999
3599999
0
4294967295
-- saturate: out-of-range numeric VALUES expression must clamp to the boundary
-3599999
3599999
0
4294967295
-- ignore: out-of-range numeric VALUES expression must clamp too, not store the raw value
-3599999
3599999
0
4294967295
-- in-range numeric VALUES expression is unchanged in all modes
-3600
3600
-- throw: out-of-range Date / Date32 VALUES expression must raise
-- saturate: out-of-range Date / Date32 VALUES expression must clamp to the boundary
2106-02-07
1900-01-01
2299-12-31
-- ignore: out-of-range Date / Date32 VALUES expression must clamp too
2106-02-07
1900-01-01
2299-12-31
-- saturate: Float64 and wide-integer VALUES expressions clamp for every target
2106-02-07	2299-12-31	2106-02-07 06:28:15	999:59:59
2106-02-07	2299-12-31	2106-02-07 06:28:15	999:59:59
-- VALUES coercion agrees with CAST across the Date day-number / timestamp boundary (saturate)
VALUES	1970-01-01
VALUES	1970-01-02
VALUES	2106-02-07
VALUES	2149-06-06
CAST  	1970-01-01
CAST  	1970-01-02
CAST  	2106-02-07
CAST  	2149-06-06
-- VALUES coercion agrees with CAST for a fractional Date32 day number at the boundary (ignore)
120528.5	VALUES	2299-12-30	CAST	2299-12-30
120529.5	VALUES	2299-12-31	CAST	2299-12-31
120530.5	VALUES	1970-01-02	CAST	1970-01-02
-- VALUES coercion agrees with CAST for a fractional Date32 day number at the boundary (saturate)
120528.5	VALUES	2299-12-30	CAST	2299-12-30
120529.5	VALUES	2299-12-31	CAST	2299-12-31
120530.5	VALUES	1970-01-02	CAST	1970-01-02
-- values() table function agrees with CAST for the same fractional Date32 day numbers
120528.5	VALUES	2299-12-30	CAST	2299-12-30
120529.5	VALUES	2299-12-31	CAST	2299-12-31
120530.5	VALUES	1970-01-02	CAST	1970-01-02
